# Dack Fayden, Helping Hand goads for the rest of the game (Duration::Indefinite), while the Undercity's Arena goads only
# until its controller's next turn. Bot1's Dack puts Bot2's Llanowar Elves onto the battlefield goaded by Bot1 on turn 1;
# Bot2 takes the initiative on turn 2 and reaches the Arena on turn 6, goading the same Elves, so on turn 6 it is goaded
# by both (CR 701.15b, two separate goads). On turn 8 the Arena's goad has expired and Dack's is still there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Dack Fayden, Helping Hand
Island
Island
Forest
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Caves of Chaos Adventurer
Island
Island
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dack Fayden, Helping Hand.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Caves of Chaos Adventurer.Cast
